// CSV in.
//
// Stage 124's adopt-existing-stock path is the careful half of getting a
// running distillery into Stillhouse — one cask at a time, from a scale
// and a hydrometer, with the determination trail intact. This is the
// boring half: the four hundred rows somebody already has in a
// spreadsheet.
//
// Three properties matter more than the parsing. A dry run is always
// available, because an import that can only be found out about by doing
// it is one nobody runs on real data. Every row lands in one
// transaction, so a failure on row 380 leaves nothing behind. And every
// rejection names its row and says what is wrong in a sentence.

